&lt;li&gt;Partners are embedded within regional account planning and sales activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Joint initiatives are producing measurable pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner activity is accurately tracked and reported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mixpanel has stronger partner coverage across priority EMEA markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in partnerships, channel sales or partner management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the EMEA partner landscape, particularly Southern Europe, the Middle East and Africa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional European or regional languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in high-growth markets or using AI tools in your daily work.&lt;/li&gt;
