&lt;li&gt;Define, manage, and provide insights on key performance indicators across a range of segments, geographies, and go-to-market teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with sales, finance, revenue operations, marketing, and other cross-functional stakeholders to design and execute strategic projects to drive growth, increase sales productivity, operational efficiency, and revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
