&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a creative and results-driven campaign manager to support our growth in APAC, based out of our Singapore office. The campaign manager will be the strategist and owner of integrated campaigns that drive quality new business and expansion pipeline. The role requires creativity, an understanding of multiple marketing channels, and strong project management and collaboration skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the strategy for campaigns in APAC, including campaign objectives, targeting, messaging/positioning, budget and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with teammates within APAC and globally to execute campaign deliverables (e.g. content creation, paid media, on/offline events, direct mail)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively partner with campaign managers globally to create the global campaign plan and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localize campaigns to drive increased engagement in key markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closely monitor performance metrics and proactively optimize programs and processes to deliver on pipeline goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for someone who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has at least 6+ years of experience with B2B/SaaS marketing or the analytics space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong communications, project management and execution skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loves collaborating with global teammates and cross-functional teams (marketing, sales, partners, pre-sales, post-sales)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is positive and energetic with a strong ownership mentality - from plan to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Likes being hands-on and is ready to go outside of the box to make things work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learns quickly and has the ability to solve problems independently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a strong focus on driving outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
