&lt;li&gt;Previous work experience at a high-growth start-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with paid media channels (Google, Facebook, LinkedIn, etc) and how to use them to drive campaign success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects at the same time in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with marketing tech tools (ex., Hubspot, Salesforce, Clay, RollWorks, Qualified)&lt;/li&gt;
